{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26615","headline":"送独孤焕评事赴丰州 · 姚合","name":"送独孤焕评事赴丰州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东门携酒送廷评，结束从军塞上行。\n深碛路移唯马觉，断蓬风起与鵰平。\n烟生远戍侵云色，冰叠黄河长雪声。\n须凿燕然山上石，登科记里是闲名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}